 1. WHY THEY ARE SKIPPED (do not "force" them — they EARNO the skip)
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

The test suites gate themselves on a runtime prerequisite and call
`describe.skip` / `it.skip` when it is missing:

  * TEST_POSTGRES_URL  -> a real PostgreSQL the test process can reach.
  * .venv/bin/python   -> a project-local Python virtualenv with
                          numpy, scipy, pandas, scikit-learn AND nbformat.

The skip logic is intentional so CI without Postgres/Python still runs
everything else. To run them: provide the runtime, that is all.

