 5. HOW TO RUN (exact commands, from aerolexa-main)
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

  # Unit, connectors + scheduler (needs TEST_POSTGRES_URL only):
  TEST_POSTGRES_URL=postgres://... npx jest --runInBand --testTimeout=25000 \
    --testPathPattern='__tests__/unit/(connectors-postgres|connector-scheduler)'

  # Unit, python-export (needs only the .venv):
  npx jest --runInBand --testTimeout=30000 \
    --testPathPattern='__tests__/unit/python-export'

  # Full unit suite (all non-API tests, warns on open handles at the end —
  # result counts are still printed; ignore the "did not exit" note):
  npx jest --runInBand --testTimeout=25000 --silent \
    --testPathIgnorePatterns='__tests__/api'

  # API suite incl. connectors (needs TEST_POSTGRES_URL). MUST target
  # __tests__/api — global-setup ONLY boots the dev server (port 3210)
  # when the pattern contains __tests__/api; otherwise everything
  # ECONNREFUSEDs against 127.0.0.1:3210:
  TEST_POSTGRES_URL=postgres://... npx jest --runInBand --testTimeout=30000 \
    --testPathPattern='__tests__/api'

